> Baby silver dragons don't reflect.
> Don't ask me why.
It looks like an inconsistency, since every other color of baby dragon
receives the benefit of its respective scale armor.

However, in the source (muse.c, line 2058), there is a comment:
# /* Silver dragons only reflect when mature; babies do not */

So this appears to be deliberate on the part of the DevTeam.  Even though
they also added a special case so that baby gray dragons *do* get their
bonus (magic missile immunity).

